\title{mossyforest: Network Aware Stability Selection with Random Forests}
\description{
An interpretable, network aware random forest feature selection framework for high dimensional and correlated data. It combines module stratified recursive feature elimination, shadow stability selection, and 'TreeSHAP' (Tree SHapley Additive exPlanations) importance, with modules either provided by the user or derived with 'WGCNA' (weighted gene co expression network analysis). The default backend requires a 'Python' environment with 'scikit-learn', 'shap', and 'numpy', which can be configured with mf_setup(). A pure 'R' backend based on 'ranger' is also available.
}
